markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Examples of AI Use

#### Review the following examples of ways that students can use AI within a classroom or at home to support their learning.

>#### 💬 **Quick Reflection:** As you read think about which of these scenarios are ones you would feel comfortable implementing in your own classroom. Which ones wouldn't you implement and why?

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-top: 15px;">
  
<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/74cd4e2369d3fc68024d19aa164f3e77-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.44 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">A student drafts a claim-evidence-reasoning paragraph for a lab report, then asks AI for two revision options. The student evaluates both, notes what improved, rejects inaccurate science, and produces a final version with a short explanation of what they changed and why.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/36fbd1519b267daab49c5e56032ac2e5-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.28 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">An 8th-grade English student writes a literary analysis essay and asks AI to improve clarity and make the writing more sophisticated. The student reviews the suggestions and accepts most of them. The final essay is stronger and now mirrors work typically produced by a 12th-grade student.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/79b1233d96849775ef76ef1f73f02ca4-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.01.59 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">After a lesson on symbolism in literature, a student asks AI to generate five quick questions. The student answers without notes, then asks AI to explain why each correct answer is correct and where their incorrect answers went off track.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/36fbd1519b267daab49c5e56032ac2e5-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.28 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">Before beginning a social studies presentation, a student asks AI to outline a possible structure for organizing their slides. The student adjusts the outline to fit their topic and fills in the content using their class notes and research.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/70c1ca931790351868059db748869eaa-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.12 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">A 10th-grade student is stuck on cellular respiration. They ask AI to explain it in three different ways, then summarize the explanation in their own words and identify one question they still have.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/36fbd1519b267daab49c5e56032ac2e5-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.28 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">A student uses AI to brainstorm project ideas, selects one, and creates a plan with milestones. In a conference, the student explains and justifies key choices to demonstrate ownership of the work.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/58c41bce591f6f537a6f05ea6cccbd34-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.17 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">A 7th-grade math student solving multi-step equations asks AI for a hint and one similar worked example. The student completes the problem and reflects on the error they corrected.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/36fbd1519b267daab49c5e56032ac2e5-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.28 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">A high school student researching renewable energy asks AI to suggest additional angles for their argument. The student incorporates two suggestions and later looks for sources that support those ideas.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/b89d7ef318c1cf734fe77e43a383e684-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.23 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">In a civics unit, a student writes their argument first, then uses AI to generate counterarguments. The student strengthens their reasoning while documenting which AI suggestions they used and which they rejected.</p>
</div>

<!-- Scenario -->
<div style="background:#fff; padding:15px; text-align:center; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border:2px solid #5a2ca0; font-size:18px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/ea5377f42ea970179efa9f124600378b-Screenshot 2026-02-04 at 3.02.39 PM.png" alt="Illustrated classroom scenario involving AI use" style="width:100%; height:120px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#ececec;">
<p style="font-size:14px;">During a design project, students keep an AI use log documenting prompts, suggestions, and reflections about when the tool helped and when it didn’t.</p>
</div>

</div>
MARKDOWN
